1
00:00:22,620 --> 00:00:23,624
早上...好
Oh! Oh. Good morn-ing.

2
00:00:27,140 --> 00:00:29,117
我怎么度过暑假的
How did I spend my summer vacation?

3
00:00:29,158 --> 00:00:30,671
我熬过了跟安迪分手的失恋期
I got over my breakup with Andy.

4
00:00:31,054 --> 00:00:32,605
我在爷爷的乡村俱乐部找了份工作
I got a job at Grandpa's country club.

5
00:00:32,988 --> 00:00:34,879
-我得了接吻病  -太近了
- I got mono. - Too close!

6
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:35,765
快戴上你的口罩
Put your mask on!

7
00:00:36,952 --> 00:00:39,089
加州理工从来没有人缺课两周还能跟上进度
No one misses two weeks at Caltech and catches up.

8
00:00:39,230 --> 00:00:40,200
我该怎么办啊
What am I gonna do?

9
00:00:40,220 --> 00:00:41,957
亲爱的  我觉得你要专心想办法
Well, honey, I think you need to focus

10
00:00:42,017 --> 00:00:43,346
变得更坚强一点
on getting a little bit stronger,

11
00:00:43,366 --> 00:00:46,206
更健康一点  然后更远一点
a little bit healthier and just a little farther.

12
00:00:46,629 --> 00:00:47,979
书呆宅女怎么会得这种病啊
How do nerds even get mono?

13
00:00:47,999 --> 00:00:49,854
难道你们是跟同一个枕头练习接吻吗
Did you all practice by kissing the same pillow?

14
00:00:50,237 --> 00:00:51,588
你现在不是应该在工作了吗
Shouldn't you be at work by now?

15
00:00:52,556 --> 00:00:53,120
我被炒了
I got fired.

16
00:00:53,240 --> 00:00:55,826
我打算找到新工作后再告诉我爸妈
My plan was to hide it from my parents until I got a new job,

17
00:00:55,846 --> 00:00:57,200
但是爱耍聪明的艾丽克斯在家
but with smarty-pants Alex home,

18
00:00:57,280 --> 00:00:59,604
我得更小心一点  不然她会发现的
I had to be more careful, or she was going to figure it out.

19
00:01:00,169 --> 00:01:02,589
她病得这么重对我来说简直太不是时候了
Her being super-sick is coming at a really bad time for me.

20
00:01:04,260 --> 00:01:05,508
你昨晚很晚到家啊
You got in late last night, huh?

21
00:01:05,831 --> 00:01:06,918
对啊  昨天是发薪日
Yeah. It was payday,

22
00:01:06,938 --> 00:01:08,591
厨房里一言不合就开始骰子大战
and a game of craps broke out in the kitchen.

23
00:01:09,014 --> 00:01:11,232
看到这块儿表了吗  恩里克的爷爷的
See this watch? Enrique's grandfather's.

24
00:01:11,414 --> 00:01:14,098
你得还回去  还有记住  那份工作
You're giving it back, and remember, the second that job

25
00:01:14,139 --> 00:01:15,633
要是影响了你的成绩  你就得辞职
interferes with your grades, you're done.

26
00:01:15,674 --> 00:01:17,086
你写完历史报告了吗
Did you finish your history report?

27
00:01:17,147 --> 00:01:18,942
边边角角再补充一下
Just got to dot the I's and cross the T's...

28
00:01:19,829 --> 00:01:21,180
然后再补上其他所有字就行啦
and put in all the other letters.

29
00:01:21,340 --> 00:01:27,522
没事的  各位
It's okay, everybody!

30
00:01:27,542 --> 00:01:27,763
我还活著
I'm alive!

31
00:01:27,783 --> 00:01:30,754
开放参观日结束后  我有了段惨痛的经历
I had a traumatic experience after an open house.

32
00:01:32,018 --> 00:01:32,560
祝你们愉快
Have a good one.

33
00:01:49,980 --> 00:01:52,420
糟糕
Oh, no.

34
00:02:12,860 --> 00:02:15,261
周一午餐  周一晚餐
Monday lunch, Monday dinner.

35
00:02:16,170 --> 00:02:17,360
周二早餐  周二午餐
Tuesday breakfast, Tuesday lunch.

36
00:02:26,900 --> 00:02:27,766
欢迎回家
Welcome home.

37
00:02:28,652 --> 00:02:31,370
开放参观非常顺利  来了很多感兴趣的买家
Open house went great. Lots of interested buyers.

38
00:02:31,471 --> 00:02:34,052
好玩的事实  在很久很久以前
Fun fact -- Some stranger, probably a long time ago,

39
00:02:34,436 --> 00:02:36,680
有人在你们家墙上写下了遗嘱与遗言
wrote their last will and testament right here on your wall.

40
00:02:38,040 --> 00:02:38,986
放著我来
Trust me on this.

41
00:02:41,159 --> 00:02:43,192
没人发现我消失了18个小时吗
Did nobody notice I was gone for 18 hours?

42
00:02:43,252 --> 00:02:44,520
你们怎么没在制作寻人启事啊
Why aren't you all making posters?

43
00:02:44,780 --> 00:02:46,194
我以为你在办公室呢
I figured you were in your office.

44
00:02:46,558 --> 00:02:47,952
我昨晚很早就睡了
I went to bed really early last night,

45
00:02:47,972 --> 00:02:50,030
我今早起床的时候  以为你去跑步了
and when I woke up this morning, I thought you'd gone for a run.

46
00:02:50,070 --> 00:02:52,831
艾丽克斯呢  难以置信
Alex? I can't believe this!

47
00:02:53,093 --> 00:02:55,814
亲爱的  重要的是你没事
Well, honey, the important thing is that you are okay.

48
00:02:55,834 --> 00:02:57,851
我很抱歉  但是我得去上班了
Now, I'm very sorry, but I've got to get to work.

49
00:02:57,891 --> 00:03:00,573
我们要跟老对手衣柜衣柜衣柜衣柜公司
We are bidding a big job against my old nemesis,

50
00:03:00,674 --> 00:03:02,893
竞标一个大项目
Closets, Closets, Closets, Closets.

51
00:03:02,913 --> 00:03:03,720
这名字让我噩梦重现啊
I'm back in there.

52
00:03:17,500 --> 00:03:19,519
我想住在外面
I want to live outside.

53
00:03:19,539 --> 00:03:21,780
不行  先生  我们不要再争这个事了
No, Senor, we're not having that argument anymore.

54
00:03:22,300 --> 00:03:23,329
毛克利就住在外面
Mowgli lives outside.

55
00:03:23,349 --> 00:03:25,590
毛克利就是他幼儿园里那个
Is Mowgli that dirty kid at his preschool

56
00:03:25,630 --> 00:03:27,868
父母开炸薯条油驱动车的脏小孩吗
whose parents drive the car that runs on French fry oil?

57
00:03:28,170 --> 00:03:31,211
不是  是《丛林奇谭》书里跑来跑去的脏小孩
No. It's that dirty kid that runs around "The Jungle Book."

58
00:03:31,231 --> 00:03:32,550
杰  告诉他不可以住外面
Jay, tell him he can't.

59
00:03:32,560 --> 00:03:35,001
我第一次看《人猿泰山》的时候  也想住外面
First time I saw "Tarzan," I wanted to live outside.

60
00:03:35,041 --> 00:03:37,964
老爸说可以  我就走进森林里  认识了个流浪汉
Dad said fine. I walked in the woods, met a hobo.

61
00:03:38,770 --> 00:03:40,663
他教我用鸟喙开罐头
Taught me how to open a can with a bird's beak.

62
00:03:40,824 --> 00:03:42,476
这故事可没有帮助
That story's not helping!

63
00:03:42,516 --> 00:03:43,765
我非去不可
I'm doing it.

64
00:03:43,966 --> 00:03:45,034
不行  杰
No! Jay!

65
00:03:45,296 --> 00:03:45,961
当然不行
Of course not.

66
00:03:46,243 --> 00:03:48,318
为何要学习自力更生
Why learn self-reliance when the industrial machine

67
00:03:48,359 --> 00:03:49,608
工业机器就仰仗不断的消耗不是吗
depends on constant consumption?

68
00:03:50,212 --> 00:03:51,925
我不吃蛋了  我喝粥
No eggs for me. I'll be having porridge.

69
00:03:52,368 --> 00:03:53,980
你还要继续来这套吗
Are you really still doing this?

70
00:03:54,220 --> 00:03:57,085
这个夏天  我去华雷斯参加婚礼时认识了弗里达
Over the summer, I went to a wedding in Ju·rez and met Frida,

71
00:03:57,348 --> 00:03:58,901
这个超棒的姑娘启发了我
this amazing girl who enlightened me

72
00:03:58,921 --> 00:04:01,054
共产主义会如何消除世界上的不公
to how Communism can rid the world of injustice.

73
00:04:02,725 --> 00:04:04,315
多华丽的婚宴啊
Mm. What a beautiful reception.

74
00:04:04,697 --> 00:04:05,180
可不
Yeah.

75
00:04:06,220 --> 00:04:07,489
对  这不是好事
Oh, right. That's a bad thing.

76
00:04:08,597 --> 00:04:10,248
我现在生活很朴素  对我也有好处
I live simply now, and it's good for me.

77
00:04:10,812 --> 00:04:13,473
这可能助我有朝一日亲到她吗  是的
Might it also help my chance of kissing her one day? Yes.

78
00:04:14,018 --> 00:04:15,591
如果这意味著我必须生活在一个
And if that requires living in a world

79
00:04:15,651 --> 00:04:18,091
由政府选择我们所有歌曲的世界  也没关系
where the government chooses all our songs, so be it.

80
00:04:18,696 --> 00:04:19,623
我要端杯咖啡
I'm gonna take a coffee

81
00:04:19,643 --> 00:04:21,316
给装监控摄像头的家伙
to the guy putting up the security cameras.

82
00:04:21,518 --> 00:04:24,140
劳动者需要的不是咖啡  杰  是尊严
It's not coffee the laborers need, Jay. It's dignity.

83
00:04:24,402 --> 00:04:25,431
我要为此抗争
And I'm going to fight for that

84
00:04:25,451 --> 00:04:27,085
直到我擦破手指  压弯脊背
until my fingers are raw and my back is bent.

85
00:04:27,569 --> 00:04:29,828
六个月前  你还因为泡了太多泡泡浴
Six months ago, we took you to the dermatologist

86
00:04:29,848 --> 00:04:31,360
被我们带去看皮肤科医生
for taking too many bubble baths.

87
00:04:33,600 --> 00:04:34,124
给你倒了杯咖啡
Brought you this.

88
00:04:34,789 --> 00:04:36,100
谢谢  快搞定了
Oh, thanks. Almost done here.

89
00:04:36,281 --> 00:04:36,906
慢慢来
Take your time.

90
00:04:37,672 --> 00:04:38,318
重要的是...
Important thing is...

91
00:04:42,220 --> 00:04:42,844
糟糕
Oh, no.

92
00:04:43,791 --> 00:04:44,355
你猜怎么著
Guess what.

93
00:04:44,878 --> 00:04:46,731
我装上监控摄像头的同一天
A black family's moving in right across the street

94
00:04:46,792 --> 00:04:49,090
对面搬来了一家黑人
the same day my security cameras are going up.

95
00:04:49,252 --> 00:04:50,382
我也很无奈啊
Well, what am I supposed to do?

96
00:04:50,483 --> 00:04:51,876
我几周前就预约了
I made the appointment weeks ago

97
00:04:51,917 --> 00:04:53,391
这条街上发生了入室盗窃之后约的
right after the break-in down the street.

98
00:04:53,997 --> 00:04:56,077
但他们会以为我是看到他们才安装
But they'll think I made the call the minute I saw them

99
00:04:56,137 --> 00:04:57,729
因为我是个种族歧视的老男人
because I'm a racist old man.

100
00:04:57,910 --> 00:05:00,891
为什么邻居会假设你有种族歧视呢
Why would the neighbors just assume that you're a racist?

101
00:05:00,912 --> 00:05:02,110
歌洛莉亚  歌洛莉亚  歌洛莉亚
Gloria, Gloria, Gloria.

102
00:05:02,120 --> 00:05:05,014
你永远不会理解白人老男人所面临的成见
You'll never understand the stereotypes old white men face.

103
00:05:05,034 --> 00:05:08,691
进了
Goal!

104
00:05:08,711 --> 00:05:09,776
好球  汤姆
Nice shot, Tom.

105
00:05:09,796 --> 00:05:11,245
你想跟我们一起玩吗
Do you want to play with us?

106
00:05:11,265 --> 00:05:12,840
我现在不玩硬汉接触性运动了
You know, I'm off contact sports right now.

107
00:05:12,901 --> 00:05:14,778
因为我玩跑步猜谜时把脚踝扭了
I twisted my ankle playing running charades,

108
00:05:14,798 --> 00:05:17,288
但你俩该准备去上舞蹈课了
but you two should get ready for dance class.

109
00:05:17,429 --> 00:05:18,574
快点去
Okay, go. Go, go, go!

110
00:05:23,197 --> 00:05:24,791
你为什么看起来这么心满意足
Okay, why do you look so satisfied?

111
00:05:24,811 --> 00:05:26,249
是不是刚听到证明
Did you just listen to an NPR story

112
00:05:26,289 --> 00:05:27,240
你某件事说对了的广播报道
that proved you right about something?

113
00:05:27,360 --> 00:05:28,754
不  但你知道汤姆吧
No, no, but you know Tom,

114
00:05:28,915 --> 00:05:30,147
跟莉莉一起玩的朋友
the friend that Lily's playing with?

115
00:05:30,269 --> 00:05:32,466
我听说过  但莉莉还没正式介绍我们认识
Well, I know of him. We haven't formally been introduced.

116
00:05:32,486 --> 00:05:37,012
其实汤姆以前是女孩缇娜呢
Well, it turns out that Tom used to identify as...Tina.

117
00:05:37,937 --> 00:05:38,965
真希望你没有告诉我这事
Oh, I wish you wouldn't have told me.

118
00:05:38,986 --> 00:05:40,156
我本来对自己的性别识别雷达很自豪呢
You know how proud I am of my gender identificadar.

119
00:05:41,872 --> 00:05:43,888
汤姆在学校一直不太顺遂
Well, Tom's been having some problems at school,

120
00:05:43,968 --> 00:05:46,566
但莉莉一直都很尊重他
and -- and Lily has been really respectful of him.

121
00:05:46,586 --> 00:05:48,056
她太贴心了
Oh, she is so sweet.

122
00:05:48,096 --> 00:05:48,941
是的
She really is.

123
00:05:49,464 --> 00:05:50,891
这一切全是她自己的功劳
She gets all the credit on this one.

124
00:05:54,469 --> 00:05:55,534
谁的功劳真的不重要
This so doesn't matter.

125
00:05:55,554 --> 00:05:57,507
是我们教育她要勇于接受新事物
We raised her to have an open mind.

126
00:05:57,527 --> 00:05:59,867
的确  我们也应该被点个赞
Totally. We deserve some kudos here, too.

127
00:05:59,887 --> 00:06:01,400
点的赞够我们每人都有赞了
There's enough kudos for everyone.

128
00:06:01,540 --> 00:06:04,245
"点赞"会是杰出教育奖的绝妙名字啊
You know, a kudo would be an excellent name for a parenting award.

129
00:06:04,830 --> 00:06:05,940
谢谢你  格温妮丝
Oh, thank you, Gwyneth.

130
00:06:07,542 --> 00:06:09,680
莉莉  如果你还在看颁奖转播  快去睡觉
Lily, if you're still watching, go to bed.

131
00:06:10,406 --> 00:06:12,060
滚出去  你个怪胎
Get out of here, you weirdo!

132
00:06:17,960 --> 00:06:20,460
当扫兴鬼也是当老板的一部分
Part of being the boss is being a bummer.

133
00:06:25,280 --> 00:06:28,246
一开始心里挺难受  但我逐渐学会了接受
It was hard at first, but I've learned to accept it...

134
00:06:29,356 --> 00:06:29,780
通常都能吧
mostly.

135
00:06:30,678 --> 00:06:33,677
真的很...
It's really been...

136
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:35,918
玛格丽特  你明知道我就在这里
Margaret, you knew I was in here.

137
00:06:35,978 --> 00:06:38,360
抱歉  我刚收到了一些消息
Sorry. I just had some messages.

138
00:06:38,860 --> 00:06:40,210
卢克的辅导员说
Uh-huh. Luke's guidance counselor --

139
00:06:40,250 --> 00:06:42,103
卢克又在课上睡觉了
Luke fell asleep in class again.

140
00:06:42,929 --> 00:06:44,198
海莉的汽车贷款迟交了
Haley's car payment is late.

141
00:06:44,480 --> 00:06:46,069
还有信用卡公司说
And the credit-card company.

142
00:06:46,089 --> 00:06:47,428
菲尔在一家名为
Phil made a large purchase

143
00:06:47,438 --> 00:06:51,460
应对困难蜡烛网的西藏网站上进行了大采购
on a Tibetan website called CopingCandles.Com.

144
00:06:51,580 --> 00:06:53,216
让创意团队别嬉皮笑脸了
Tell the creative team to get their giggles out.

145
00:06:53,257 --> 00:06:54,368
我十分钟后就能见他们
I'll be ready for them in 10.

146
00:06:54,913 --> 00:06:57,150
但当你上班时一直是扫兴鬼
But when you've been the bummer all day at work,

147
00:06:57,190 --> 00:07:00,270
在家时就不想也是这个身份
you don't love having to be the bummer at home, too.

148
00:07:00,290 --> 00:07:03,313
亲爱的  你弟弟在吗  我有事骂他几句
Hi, honey. Is your brother around? I need to yell at him.

149
00:07:03,596 --> 00:07:04,706
他当然在
Of course he's around.

150
00:07:04,747 --> 00:07:05,958
他怎么可能会不吵我
Why would he leave me in peace

151
00:07:05,998 --> 00:07:07,490
乖乖在餐桌上写点作业
to do some work at the kitchen table

152
00:07:07,510 --> 00:07:09,143
而不是强行冲进来...
when he could just barge in and --

153
00:07:09,223 --> 00:07:10,977
卢克  关掉游戏
Luke! Game down!

154
00:07:10,997 --> 00:07:11,884
你今年读高三
This is your senior year,

155
00:07:11,924 --> 00:07:13,575
也是你能不当废柴的最后一年了
also known as your last year to not suck.

156
00:07:14,179 --> 00:07:16,797
-亲爱的  -爸爸  你点一下"提交订单"
- Honey. - Dad, you hit "Place order" once,

157
00:07:17,140 --> 00:07:18,751
然后等著确认
and then you wait for the confirmation.

158
00:07:18,832 --> 00:07:21,048
-抱歉  -别抱歉  聪明点
- I'm sorry. - Don't be sorry! Be smart!

159
00:07:21,068 --> 00:07:22,317
那愤怒的怒吼
That angry screeching

160
00:07:22,398 --> 00:07:24,937
是我家新任扫兴鬼传来的天籁之声
was the sweet sound of my new home bummer.

161
00:07:25,461 --> 00:07:27,698
我好累  好痛苦  好烦躁
I'm just so tired and in pain and irritable.

162
00:07:27,718 --> 00:07:29,429
这让我非常生所有人的气
It just makes me so mad at everyone.

163
00:07:29,449 --> 00:07:32,024
抱歉嚷嚷了  妈妈  你为什么打电话来
Sorry for yelling, Mom. Why were you calling again?

164
00:07:32,045 --> 00:07:33,272
我忘记了
I forgot.

165
00:07:34,157 --> 00:07:36,046
去你的  妈妈  下次写下来
Damn it, Mom! Write it down next time!

166
00:07:36,086 --> 00:07:39,019
好了
All right.

167
00:07:40,907 --> 00:07:41,228
我们到了
Here we are.

168
00:07:41,269 --> 00:07:44,606
好  别忘了给放克大师琳达
