00:14:20,800 --> 00:14:22,580
每个人都或多或少心存偏见
there's a little bit of prejudice in everyone --

338
00:14:22,720 --> 00:14:23,448
无论是你  我
you, me,

339
00:14:23,873 --> 00:14:26,300
还是街对面因为监控摄像头而评判我的邻居
the neighbor across the street judging me for my cameras.

340
00:14:26,380 --> 00:14:27,850
我要去做我早就该做的事
I'm gonna do what I should have done at the beginning --

341
00:14:27,891 --> 00:14:28,278
和他们把话说开
talk to them.

342
00:14:28,720 --> 00:14:29,981
那可不是个好主意
That's not a good idea.

343
00:14:30,140 --> 00:14:30,761
你等著瞧
Watch me!

344
00:14:33,490 --> 00:14:35,520
乔  我不会让你去野外生活的
Joe, you're not going to live outside!

345
00:14:35,530 --> 00:14:36,309
好吧
Fine!

346
00:14:50,140 --> 00:14:52,782
艾丽克斯总是电脑不离身
Alex is never away from her laptop,

347
00:14:52,803 --> 00:14:54,860
所以我每次只能偷一份作业
so I had to steal assignments one at a time.

348
00:14:55,220 --> 00:14:56,351
我并不以偷窃为荣
I'm not proud of stealing,

349
00:14:56,371 --> 00:14:59,400
但我也不是不以我的手法为傲
but I'm not unproud of how I'm stealing.

350
00:15:10,060 --> 00:15:12,516
宝贝  太对不起了
Oh, honey, I'm so sorry,

351
00:15:12,637 --> 00:15:14,972
但既然你醒了
but now that you're awake,

352
00:15:14,992 --> 00:15:16,280
跟我说说家里发生什么事了
what happened in here, huh?

353
00:15:16,860 --> 00:15:18,250
让我告诉你家里发生什么事了
I'll tell you what happened here --

354
00:15:18,291 --> 00:15:22,220
一整天都是这个死样子
the same thing that's been happening all damn day!

355
00:15:22,580 --> 00:15:25,398
我周旋于这些禽兽之间
Me dealing with animals who don't care

356
00:15:25,640 --> 00:15:27,854
他们开著空调还将门窗大敞四开
that we are air-conditioning the outside

357
00:15:27,874 --> 00:15:31,267
坚持要看无趣的家庭主妇互泼红酒
and insist on rotting their brains by watching vapid housewives

358
00:15:31,328 --> 00:15:32,440
来自降智商
spit wine on each other.

359
00:15:33,260 --> 00:15:37,220
而你  连个盘子都懒得用
And you. Can't even be bothered to use a plate!

360
00:15:40,520 --> 00:15:42,180
真是个扫兴鬼  对吧
Oh, she's a bummer, huh?

361
00:15:44,180 --> 00:15:44,961
有什么好笑的吗
Something funny?

362
00:15:46,160 --> 00:15:46,582
没有
No.

363
00:15:47,460 --> 00:15:48,737
你在家做什么
What are you even doing home?

364
00:15:48,838 --> 00:15:50,540
你每周二不是要帮你老板照看猫吗
Don't you cat-sit for your boss on Tuesday nights?

365
00:15:52,180 --> 00:15:54,251
艾丽克斯  也许我带你去散个步或驾车兜风
Alex, maybe you'd feel better if we went for a walk

366
00:15:54,292 --> 00:15:55,961
你会感觉好些  开车带你去遛遛
or a ride in the car, huh? Go for a ride in the car!

367
00:15:56,020 --> 00:15:58,370
这家里让人分心的事太多了
You know what? There are just too many distractions here.

368
00:15:58,380 --> 00:16:00,960
我不在乎我病成啥样了  我得回学校去
I don't care how sick I am. I have to go back to college.

369
00:16:00,970 --> 00:16:01,150
-不行  -不行
- No! - No!

370
00:16:01,160 --> 00:16:04,540
-不行不行  -你当然得回去
- No, no, no, no, no. - Of course you do!

371
00:16:05,200 --> 00:16:06,153
你猜我是不是那种
Was I the kind of person

372
00:16:06,214 --> 00:16:08,090
会强行把病重的妹妹送回学校
who would send her sick sister back to school

373
00:16:08,100 --> 00:16:10,340
只因为不想让她发现我被解雇了的人
just to keep her from figuring out I got fired?

374
00:16:11,160 --> 00:16:12,137
那你猜我在社区大学时
Did I use her laptop

375
00:16:12,158 --> 00:16:13,420
有没有从靠她作业不挂科
to get through community college?

376
00:16:14,280 --> 00:16:17,125
让我送你回去  今天可是周五
Let's get you back there. It's Friday night.

377
00:16:17,165 --> 00:16:18,900
说不定有派对能让你远远听个热闹
Maybe there's a party you can listen to.

378
00:16:20,160 --> 00:16:22,749
-不好意思  无意打扰  -你好
- Excuse me. I don't mean to bug you. - Hello.

379
00:16:22,770 --> 00:16:24,631
你才搬过来  我就住在街对面
You're just moving in. I'm right across the street.

380
00:16:25,177 --> 00:16:26,127
-听我说  -让我猜猜看
- Listen. - Let me stop you.

381
00:16:26,753 --> 00:16:28,207
你早就预约好今天装监控摄像头
You had the cameras scheduled,

382
00:16:28,227 --> 00:16:29,216
担心我看见了会误会
worried about how it would look,

383
00:16:29,780 --> 00:16:31,344
还特意叫你的黑哥们过来
brought your black friend out,

384
00:16:31,364 --> 00:16:32,420
大声放黑人乐队的歌
blasted Commodores.

385
00:16:33,687 --> 00:16:35,848
我也不是第一次搬进白人社区了
It's not my first time moving into a white neighborhood.

386
00:16:36,495 --> 00:16:38,482
-咱之间没误会  -真的吗
- We're good. - Yeah?

387
00:16:38,492 --> 00:16:38,502
该州95%都是白人

388
00:16:38,512 --> 00:16:41,260
我在新罕布什尔州做过实习住院医生呢
I did my residency in New Hampshire.

389
00:16:41,640 --> 00:16:44,000
好  你们有什么需要尽管开口
All right. Listen, you guys need anything, let me know.

390
00:16:44,100 --> 00:16:46,540
没问题  我叫肖恩  顺带一提
You got it. I'm Shawn, by the way.

391
00:16:46,680 --> 00:16:47,983
-杰·普里契特  -杰
- Jay Pritchett. - Jay.

392
00:16:48,120 --> 00:16:50,162
没事的  歌洛莉亚  都处理好了
It's okay, Gloria. All handled.

393
00:16:50,789 --> 00:16:51,770
这是我妻子  歌洛莉亚
This is my wife, Gloria.

394
00:16:51,780 --> 00:16:54,136
这是肖恩  我希望我的发音准确
This is Shawn -- and I want to get this right,

395
00:16:54,177 --> 00:16:55,425
很美的非洲名字  肖恩·舜玳伊缇
beautiful African name -- Shawn M'badawe.

396
00:16:59,220 --> 00:17:01,740
我说的是"顺带一提"
I said, "by the way."

397
00:17:06,680 --> 00:17:08,380
莉莉  我们需要谈谈
Hey, Lily. We need to talk.

398
00:17:08,860 --> 00:17:10,760
其实我刚好有事要出门
I was actually just heading out.

399
00:17:11,049 --> 00:17:12,061
不许逃  请你坐好
No. Sit down, please.

400
00:17:13,060 --> 00:17:15,390
你对汤姆那么毒舌是不对的  知道吗
Look, it was wrong of you to be mean to Tom, okay?

401
00:17:15,400 --> 00:17:17,159
尽管你大爸和我
Even though Daddy and I

402
00:17:17,240 --> 00:17:19,060
偶尔也在本该开明时没有做到
aren't always as open-minded as we should be,

403
00:17:19,367 --> 00:17:21,060
但我们希望你能青出于蓝
we-we want you to be better than us.

404
00:17:21,156 --> 00:17:23,038
好的
O-kay.

405
00:17:23,060 --> 00:17:26,180
不许逃  我们要接受他人真实的一面
No. Listen. We accept people for who they are.

406
00:17:26,820 --> 00:17:29,120
二爸和我会无条件接受真实的你
Daddy and I would accept you no matter what --

407
00:17:29,180 --> 00:17:30,778
无论男女  无论直弯
boy, girl, gay, straight...

408
00:17:30,798 --> 00:17:31,749
不过如果你是女同
though, if you're a lesbian,

409
00:17:31,769 --> 00:17:32,800
可千万得是风趣的那种
please be the fun kind.

410
00:17:33,920 --> 00:17:36,100
我不是因为汤姆过去是缇娜才吼他
I didn't yell at Tom because he used to be Tina.

411
00:17:36,520 --> 00:17:38,741
-什么  -我吼他是因为他嘲笑...
- What? - I yelled at him 'cause he made fun of...

412
00:17:39,880 --> 00:17:40,701
嘲笑什么
Made fun of what?

413
00:17:42,300 --> 00:17:43,861
-这有什么可笑的  -谢天谢地
- What's-What's to make fun of? - Oh, thank God.

414
00:17:44,460 --> 00:17:47,027
他因为这幅画说你们是怪胎
He called you guys weirdos for putting that painting up,

415
00:17:47,047 --> 00:17:48,260
所以我才说他是怪胎
so I called him a weirdo.

416
00:17:48,400 --> 00:17:50,240
宝贝  你怎么不告诉我们
Well, honey, why didn't you tell us?

417
00:17:50,649 --> 00:17:52,200
因为我不想让你们伤心
'Cause I didn't want your feelings to get hurt.

418
00:17:52,740 --> 00:17:53,429
我们怎么会伤心
Get hurt? How?

419
00:17:53,450 --> 00:17:55,700
就因为那个无礼的汤姆不懂艺术吗
Because that rube Tom knows nothing about art?

420
00:17:55,740 --> 00:17:57,560
小卡  她一直在保护我们
Cam, she was protecting us.

421
00:17:57,640 --> 00:17:59,161
但你不必这样做的  宝贝  知道吗
But you don't have to, sweetie, okay?

422
00:17:59,300 --> 00:18:00,862
你不必为了照顾我们的感受
Don't feel like you can't be honest with us

423
00:18:00,903 --> 00:18:02,160
而有所隐瞒
just to protect our feelings.

424
00:18:02,380 --> 00:18:03,447
-真的吗  -真的
- Really? - Really.

425
00:18:03,468 --> 00:18:05,740
你有任何想法都可以告诉我们
Hey, you can tell us anything.

426
00:18:06,120 --> 00:18:06,646
好吧
Okay.

427
00:18:07,759 --> 00:18:09,520
我也讨厌那幅画
I hate the painting, too.

428
00:18:11,940 --> 00:18:16,630
听起来虽然很难受  但本著宽容的精神
It was hard for us to hear, but in the spirit of tolerance,

429
00:18:16,640 --> 00:18:18,260
我们接受一个9岁小孩
we accepted the fact that a 9-year-old

430
00:18:18,807 --> 00:18:20,488
也许不愿意入睡时
might not want to fall asleep

431
00:18:20,509 --> 00:18:22,860
伴著两个半裸的父亲注视的目光这件事
under the watchful eyes of her half-naked fathers.

432
00:18:23,080 --> 00:18:25,520
快通知西斯廷教堂的人  艺术已经过时了
Call the Sistine Chapel. I guess art is out.

433
00:18:26,260 --> 00:18:28,930
你是讨厌壁画  还是单就这...
So, do you hate the whole idea of murals, or just --

434
00:18:28,940 --> 00:18:29,342
快刷
Roll!

435
00:18:33,740 --> 00:18:35,439
绝对很兴奋吧
It's going to be so exciting

436
00:18:35,479 --> 00:18:37,420
要回到到处都是科学东西的地方
to get back to all that science stuff again.

437
00:18:37,500 --> 00:18:39,920
就是烧杯  计算器  激光枪什么的
You know -- beakers, calculators, ray guns.

438
00:18:40,100 --> 00:18:41,116
艾丽克斯  你确定你不想
Alex, are you sure you don't want

439
00:18:41,136 --> 00:18:42,660
在家多休养几天吗
to spend a few more days here to recover?

440
00:18:43,280 --> 00:18:45,310
如果你想的话  你可以睡在我们床尾啊
You can sleep on the end of our bed if you want to.

441
00:18:45,320 --> 00:18:48,461
-对  留下来  艾丽克斯  -睡一觉听起来确实不错
-Yeah, stay, Alex. -Sleeping does sound good.

442
00:18:48,620 --> 00:18:49,429
可不是吗
Doesn't it?

443
00:18:49,530 --> 00:18:52,280
但在那之前  不如先洗一个舒服的热水澡吧
But, first, how about you take a nice, hot shower?

444
00:18:52,680 --> 00:18:55,410
就是希望那一大摞湿毛巾没像今早一样
I just hope that big pile of wet towels isn't on the floor

445
00:18:55,451 --> 00:18:56,320
还在地上
like it was this morning.

446
00:18:56,869 --> 00:18:58,121
你们对我太好了
Aww, you guys are so sweet.

447
00:18:58,400 --> 00:19:00,400
别啊 想想那些科学的东西
No, but what -- what about all the science stuff?

448
00:19:00,560 --> 00:19:02,786
那些好玩的  比如用实验室护目镜头带
All the fun. You know -- snapping each other in the butts

449
00:19:02,806 --> 00:19:04,767
-互相弹对方的屁股  -其实呢
- with your goggle straps. - You know what?

450
00:19:04,787 --> 00:19:05,859
在这里多留上几天
Staying here a few more days

451
00:19:06,081 --> 00:19:07,920
也许有助我快点恢复健康
may help me kick this sickness a little faster.

452
00:19:08,000 --> 00:19:09,890
这就对了嘛  等一下
There you go. Wait a second.

453
00:19:10,033 --> 00:19:11,780
我记得我不是已经把我的电脑打包进去了吗
I thought I already packed my laptop.

454
00:19:11,840 --> 00:19:13,161
为什么它会在走廊的桌子上
Why is it on the hallway table?

455
00:19:13,740 --> 00:19:15,158
时间万物为何会出现在它出现的地方
Uh, why is anything anywhere?

456
00:19:15,198 --> 00:19:17,000
为什么我们的脚不是在胳膊的后面
Why aren't our feet at the end of our arms?

457
00:19:17,440 --> 00:19:20,020
谁打开了我高三写的《愤怒的葡萄》论文
Who opened my 12th-grade "Grapes of Wrath" essay?

458
00:19:21,140 --> 00:19:23,323
天啊  你想要我留在家
Oh, my God. You just want me to stay here

459
00:19:23,384 --> 00:19:24,900
是为了偷我以前的高中作业
so you can steal all of my old homework.

460
00:19:25,060 --> 00:19:26,442
我迫不及待要听你
Wow. I can't wait to hear what you have

461
00:19:26,462 --> 00:19:27,620
对他这次做错事有何看法
to say about this lapse in judgment.

462
00:19:27,840 --> 00:19:29,458
这也比妈妈在做的事情好多了
Hey, it's better than what Mom's doing.

463
00:19:29,762 --> 00:19:31,380
她在利用你来教训我们
She's just using you to yell at us.

464
00:19:31,400 --> 00:19:32,921
我认为这句顶嘴该扼杀在摇篮里
I would nip that back talk in the bud.

465
00:19:33,080 --> 00:19:34,621
真不敢相信  他说的是真的
I can't believe it. He's right!

466
00:19:34,840 --> 00:19:36,199
亲爱的  你又开始不开心了
Honey, you're getting upset again.

467
00:19:36,443 --> 00:19:37,660
快来  我们去给你拿零食
Come on. Let's go get a treat.

468
00:19:37,780 --> 00:19:39,598
不要那么抚摸我  还有带我散步之类的
Stop with the petting and -- and the walks.

469
00:19:40,325 --> 00:19:41,840
你就是把我当成一条治疗犬
You're using me as a therapy dog.

470
00:19:41,850 --> 00:19:42,070
这完全是无稽之...
That's ridiculi--

471
00:19:43,780 --> 00:19:44,387
我有吗
Am I?

472
00:19:44,974 --> 00:19:47,100
那卢克干的好事怎么说
Well...what about what Luke's doing?

473
00:19:47,160 --> 00:19:48,225
我们已经处理过他的问题了
We just dealt with him.

474
00:19:48,409 --> 00:19:48,900
还有  海莉
And, Haley...

475
00:19:50,220 --> 00:19:53,160
你是这个家里唯一真正关心我的人
you are the only one who really cares about me.

476
00:19:54,220 --> 00:19:56,360
就这么决定了  我要回学校
That's it! I'm going back to school.

477
00:19:56,520 --> 00:19:57,601
我开车送你  宝贝
I will drive you, sweetie.

478
00:19:57,660 --> 00:19:59,540
艾丽克斯  不要  停下  别动
Alex, no. Stop! Stay!

479
00:19:59,900 --> 00:20:01,301
快跟我说  让人类停下来是怎么说来著
How do you ask a human not to go, again?

480
00:20:01,380 --> 00:20:02,321
-艾丽克斯  等等  -对  等等
-Alex, wait! -Right.

481
00:20:03,940 --> 00:20:06,000
我们不是不走  她就是停下来喘口气
We're still leaving. She's just catching her breath.

482
00:20:06,060 --> 00:20:08,400
别这样  我感觉好糟糕  我没意识到自己犯错
Come on. I feel so bad. I had no idea what I was doing.

483
00:20:08,500 --> 00:20:10,990
那我就感觉更糟糕了  我是明知故犯
I feel worse. I really, really knew what I was doing.

484
00:20:11,000 --> 00:20:12,077
我们家又病又可怜的闺女
Our poor sick daughter.

485
00:20:12,118 --> 00:20:13,580
我们应该好好照顾她的
We should be taking care of her.

486
00:20:13,780 --> 00:20:15,098
所以我们是认识到错误就够了
So, is knowing all this enough,

487
00:20:15,118 --> 00:20:16,760
还是需要做点实际的举动呢
or do we have to, like, do something?

488
00:20:18,400 --> 00:20:19,533
我看得都心碎了
Breaks my heart.

489
00:20:19,614 --> 00:20:21,920
我看我得辞掉工作  回来照顾她到康复
I should quit my job and nurse her back to health.

490
00:20:22,200 --> 00:20:23,401
你被辞退了  对吧
You got fired, didn't you?

491
00:20:24,660 --> 00:20:26,400
艾丽克斯不得不休学一学期
Alex had to take the semester off.

492
00:20:26,480 --> 00:20:28,520
我有点失望是因为她有些失望
I was disappointed 'cause she was disappointed,

493
00:20:28,530 --> 00:20:31,620
不过我又有点暗爽她能多留在家久一点
but I was also kind of happy to have her home a little longer.

494
00:20:33,080 --> 00:20:33,542
口罩戴上
Aww. Mask!

495
00:20:37,100 --> 00:20:37,562
小卡
Cam?

496
00:20:37,800 --> 00:20:39,524
我就是想告诉她
Oh, I just wanted to tell her how proud I was

497
00:20:39,585 --> 00:20:40,690
我为她今天的表现感到很骄傲
of how she handled herself today,

498
00:20:40,700 --> 00:20:41,906
但她已经睡著了
but she's already asleep. Well,

499
00:20:41,926 --> 00:20:43,120
你可以等她明天醒来再告诉她  好吗
you can tell her in the morning, okay?

500
00:20:43,130 --> 00:20:45,160
对了  我读到一个关于
Oh, by the way, I found an article online

501
00:20:45,200 --> 00:20:46,917
黑山人艺术修复家族的文章...
about a family of Montenegrin art restorers --

502
00:20:47,220 --> 00:20:48,621
算了  宝宝  快走吧  别想它了
Let it go, babe. Come on. Come on.

503
00:20:49,240 --> 00:20:49,941
小卡
Oh, Cam.

